All axes/hammers under 25 Physical Attack stat can be upgraded via the [[Blacksmith]]. Upgrading does not affect the substats or skills that weapon provides, only the base stats.
==Equippable By==
The axe category also includes hammers, which can only be equipped by [[Werebear]]s and [[Warrior]]s/[[Breaker]]s. These classes can equip non-hammers without issue.
*[[Housecarl]]/[[Viking]]
*[[Gladiator]]/[[Berserker]]/[[Werelion]]
*[[Warrior]]/[[Breaker]]
*[[Dark Knight]]/[[Doom Knight]]
*[[Gryphon Knight]]/[[Gryphon Master]]
*[[Werebear]]
*[[Dark Marquess (Axe)]]
